+ *
+ * Acer Aspire 14 AI (A14-11M) and Aspire 16 AI (A16-11M), Snapdragon X
+ * X1-26-100. Written from the two laptops' ACPI tables on the Asus Zenbook
+ * A14 tree, whose ACPI tables describe the same USB-C, USB, GPU and HDMI
